<title>BELGIUM: TABLE-Belgian OLO exchange auction 14.88 bln bfr.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Belgian OLO exchange auction 14.88 bln bfr.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury said its linear government bond (OLO) exchange auction totalled 14.88 billion Belgian francs.</p>
<p> OLOs offered *		 amount of new OLOs sold (in bln bfr)</p>
<p> code 287 OLO 27  4.00%, Jan 2000	 4.03</p>
<p> code 285 OLO 25  5.00%, Mar 2001	 0.05</p>
<p> code 251 OLO  6  9.00%, Mar 2003	 0</p>
<p> code 265 OLO 14  7.25%, Apr 2004	10.35</p>
<p> code 257 OLO  9  8.505, Oct 2007	 0.45</p>
<p>NOTE - * in exchange for code 260 OLO 11 9.00 pct, 30 Jul 1998.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
